    "title": "General t-petal saturated slices have exact locator-flat dimension",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "For a labelled t-petal pair slice with d<h<=2d+1 and one saturated anchor, the pair space and its locator image have dimension e+1, where e=2d+1-h, and the monic locator chart is an affine e-flat. Every nonempty large-source cell surviving (PF6) satisfies these hypotheses.",
